---
name: Normalize rotated Zeek logs to OCSF
description: |
  Watches Zeek's log archive for rotated tab-separated logs and normalizes
  every new log file to OCSF. Zeek rotates the logs in `current/` into daily
  directories, such as `2026-11-17/conn.10:00:00-11:00:00.log.gz`.
---

from_file "/opt/zeek/logs/*/*.log.gz", watch=1m, max_age=1d {
  decompress_gzip
  read_zeek_tsv
}
zeek::ocsf::normalize
this = ocsf_cast(this)
